## Highlights
Pillared-layer MOF have been synthesized by ultrasonic method and characterized. Concentration of initial reagents influences the size and morphology of MOFs. High concentrations of initial reagents increases rods size of TMU-18.   
Low concentrations of initial reagents lead to nanoparticles.   
High-sensitivity detection of TNP even in the presence of other nitro compound.
